{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受信息有时过密，比喻和解释连续叠加，容易让观众来不及消化；X在人物心理动机的完整交代上更自然、稳妥。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用重点加亮让人物每一阶段的核心变化更容易被抓住，又把感受拆成与音乐进程对应的具体片段，观众可以一边听一边获得声音、身体和情绪的多层信息。水波、小船、漂浮、浪潮等意象贯穿前后，使整段经历更像一个连续的过程，细腻程度也明显胜过X。不过X对人物为什么犹豫、为什么害怕、为什么改变的解释更完整，Y有些地方则把感受说得太满。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d6ccce45-0a8e-430d-ae7d-569180bf2830", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T215259062737Z", "elapsed_seconds": 17.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:53:16.413440+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ca5bdae1d3d9bd31d24250013088c8e2292c4e585028b144e457bd653d722bce", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e